From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Phil Reif <pr@sambal.net>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 11:30:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: roll dice bot results as 3D dice
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Dice bots append a marker link [🎲](#chatto-dice:<kind>.<sides>.<value>,...)
to their roll message. The renderer turns it into a replay button and,
when the message arrives live in the open conversation, throws the dice
across the window with a small dependency-free WebGL overlay. Daggerheart
Hope/Fear dice are coloured and labelled; Savage Worlds Wild Dice are
labelled and an optional ;sw= parameter shows the trait roll result
(critical failure, failure, success, raises). The overlay is switchable
per device in Settings → Appearance (off by default with reduced motion).
